        prompts: {
          human: 'Welcome to Humbug, the 18th-century perfect information whist game. You and your opponent each get 26 cards, all laid out face-up before play. No hidden informationâ€”you know exactly what each player holds. The trump suit is set by the final card. Play 52 tricks, follow suit if able, and win more than 26 tricks to claim victory.',
          ai: 'Game: Humbug (Perfect Information 2-Player Whist). Setup: 52-card deck, 26 cards each, all face-up. Trump: Final card determines trump suit. Gameplay: 52 tricks, non-dealer leads first. Follow suit if able; else any card. Highest suit card or trump wins trick. Scoring: Win >26 tricks = win deal. Revoke (fail to follow) = lose 3 tricks. Strategic depth: Perfect information requires optimal play calculation.',
